  <h1>Hi, I'm Adithya. This is where I work.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    Engineer in Bengaluru. I put machine learning on tiny chips at IISc,
    co-founded IXE Tronics to build a moisture meter for cashew processors,
    and I teach. Most of it comes from not being able to leave things
    half-understood. Everything on this bench goes somewhere.
